        "id": 22744,
        "name": "Red Legacy",
        "username": "Red_Legacy",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/82dd89/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-09-21T14:55:46.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I do apologize for posting a character idea… even though I was just being silly. Never heard of anything like that on a gaming forum before. FFG forums are full of player ideas, dream cards, and even fully mocked playing pieces. Not sure why your lawyers would have an issue with it and theirs wouldn’t, but I should have read the forum rules first so I take full responsiblity for it.</p>\n<p>Also, I really was aware of the expansion leaks you had regarding the rat guy… I even read the brief play test post that was up. I think I let my enthusiasum get the better of me. No worries, its dead now.</p>\n<p>I feel like I just got my head bit off for posting a light hearted, happy post… I think I’ll go mosey over to a more friendly forum.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:56:46.775Z",
